% composition-bridge: Listen for the bright family of steelpan tone colours and the way calypso singing can celebrate the instrument and its players.
% composition-context: Steelpan was created in Trinidad and Tobago and developed through community innovation and competition. This original classroom parade uses voices or barred instruments; it is not calypso and not a steelband score.
% composition-distance: Original tune and words; no line from Lord Kitchener's copyrighted song is copied.
