% dossier-honesty: New beginner tune, with steelpan used only as a listening focus.
% dossier-licence: Draft original; reference song and recording remain copyrighted.
% dossier-respect: Say steelpan, not steel drum; locate Trinidad and Tobago and show a real steel orchestra before classroom instruments imitate brightness.
% dossier-review: Trinidadian steelpan educator and early-years teacher.
